cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, or cite the values it establishes, please cite the archived version below."
title: "OEISHeadroom: verified extensions to seven OEIS sequences"
abstract: >-
  A filter over all 399,277 OEIS sequences for counting sequences whose published
  data stops at a value small enough that the wall was patience rather than
  difficulty, and independent implementations of seven of them. Each
  implementation is checked by a default-deny gate that first recomputes every
  term the OEIS already publishes, and only then reports what lies past them:
  123 new terms across A319381, A323586, A325555, A325556, A337114, A347414 and
  A353403.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Leo Y.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-1145-7969"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Leo-Y-Zhang/OEISHeadroom"
license-url: "https://github.com/Leo-Y-Zhang/OEISHeadroom/blob/main/LICENSE"
